PulseNest runner for the incunest_afe4490 host unit tests
=========================================================

Since 2026-10-30 the suites (Unity), the CMake project and Unity itself live in the library's
repository, lib/incunest_afe4490/test/ (spec §9.10), where GitHub Actions runs them on every push
and every tag. Their history before that date is in this repository (test_lib/test_*/).

    python test_lib/runner/run_host_tests.py
    python test_lib/runner/run_host_tests.py hr1 spo2    # only suites matching a filter
    python test_lib/runner/run_host_tests.py --clean     # rebuild from scratch

The runner makes sure lib/incunest_afe4490 is there (scripts/get_lib.py: the junction on the
development machine, or the pinned tag cloned from GitHub), then runs the library's
test/run_host_tests.py with the build directory in test_lib/runner/build. Needs cmake, ninja and
a host g++ on PATH (MinGW-w64 on Windows).
